ext-xs text-left border-b border-slate-700\"><th class=\"pb-2\">VIX Regime</th><th class=\"pb-2\">VIX Range</th><th class=\"pb-2\">Min Score</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"space-y-1\"><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-700/50\"><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-300\">Low</td><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-400\">&lt; 15</td><td class=\"py-1.5 font-semibold\">60</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-700/50\"><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-300\">Normal</td><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-400\">15–20</td><td class=\"py-1.5 font-semibold\">60</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-700/50\"><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-300\">Elevated</td><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-400\">20–30</td><td class=\"py-1.5 font-semibold\">65</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-700/50\"><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-300\">High</td><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-400\">&gt; 30</td><td class=\"py-1.5 font-semibold\">72</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">After-Tax Minimums (30% rate)</h2><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs text-left border-b border-slate-700\"><th class=\"pb-2\">Timeframe</th><th class=\"pb-2\">Net After-Tax</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-700/50\"><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-300\">Intraday (0–1d)</td><td class=\"py-1.5 text-green-400 font-semibold\">+3%</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-700/50\"><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-300\">Short-term (4–30d)</td><td class=\"py-1.5 text-green-400 font-semibold\">+5%</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-700/50\"><td class=\"py-1.5 text-slate-300\">Medium-term (30–90d)</td><td class=\"py-1.5 text-green-400 font-semibold\">+7%</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Risk Hard Rules</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-400 shrink-0\">■</span>Max 2 new positions/day</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-400 shrink-0\">■</span>Max 20% equity deployed per session</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-400 shrink-0\">■</span>Agentic account only (cash, T+1 settlement)</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-400 shrink-0\">■</span>Stop loss: 7% below entry (standard), 5% below (elevated VIX)</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-400 shrink-0\">■</span>No trades when macro_go = false</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-400 shrink-0\">■</span>Manual APPROVE required before any execution</li></ul></section><section class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Trailing Stop Ladder</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-green-400 shrink-0\">+15%</span>Move stop to breakeven</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-green-400 shrink-0\">+25%</span>Trail 10% below peak</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-green-400 shrink-0\">+35%</span>Trail 8% below peak</li></ul></section><section class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Exit Triggers</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-slate-500 shrink-0\">1<!-- -->.</span>Stop loss hit</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-slate-500 shrink-0\">2<!-- -->.</span>Price target reached → review whether to hold</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-slate-500 shrink-0\">3<!-- -->.</span>Timeframe expired</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-slate-500 shrink-0\">4<!-- -->.</span>Original thesis invalidated (earnings miss, guidance cut, etc.)</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-slate-500 shrink-0\">5<!-- -->.</span>Trailing stop triggered</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-slate-500 shrink-0\">6<!-- -->.</span>Sector rotation turns against position</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-slate-500 shrink-0\">7<!-- -->.</span>Manual exit (your call)</li></ul></section><section class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-blue-400\">Learning Period</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-300\">No trade execution through 2026-06-28. Debates and prediction logging run normally to build calibration data.</p></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><nav class=\"fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 max-w-[480px] mx-auto bg-slate-800 border-t border-slate-700 flex\"><a class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center py-2 text-xs gap-0.5 transition-colors\n              text-slate-400\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">📊</span>Home</a><a class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center py-2 text-xs gap-0.5 transition-colors\n              text-slate-400\" href=\"/predictions\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">📋</span>Trades</a><a class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center py-2 text-xs gap-0.5 transition-colors\n              text-slate-400\" href=\"/approvals\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">✅</span>Approve</a><a class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center py-2 text-xs gap-0.5 transition-colors\n              text-slate-400\" href=\"/performance\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">📈</span>Stats</a><a class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center py-2 text-xs gap-0.5 transition-colors\n              text-slate-400\" href=\"/positions\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">💼</span>Holdings</a></nav><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[8342,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-c608d1f4686e6c69.js\\\"],\\\"defa